  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening conservation processes led by three community-based organizations in the municipalities of Bolivar, El Dovio and Versailles in the north of Valle del Cauca, Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corporacin Socioecolgica para el Futuro de Bolivar (Ecofuturo) will work in the municipalities of Bolivar, El Dovio and Versalles, department of Valle del Cauca, to improve land use in 50 private reserves and on farms, offer educational activities on conservation in five rural schools facilitate collaboration involving community residents and local authorities toward the designation of three sections of public land as protected areas. The project is expected to benefit 385 Colombians directly and another 6,000 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
